Package: duckdf
Type: Package
Title: SQL for Dataframes, But With Ducks
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Phill", "Clarke", email = "phill@fastmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Like SQL? Like dataframes? Like ducks? Then duckdf is for
    you. Run SQL queries against R dataframes on an in-memory DuckDB
    connection: zero-copy view registration, no tidyverse dependencies.
